faqs:
- q: Do you offer a packing service for house moves?
  a: Yes. Packing of all rooms is included from Bronze Essentials at {bronze}, with fragile items protected and boxes labelled by destination room. The service is open to anyone, not only older people.
- q: How much does a packing service cost?
  a: Packing and an insured removal start at {bronze} with Bronze Essentials. Silver Comfort at {silver} adds declutter help, a deep clean and unpacking. A Discovery Consultation costs {discovery}. The final cost depends on the size of the home and the help you need.
- q: Do you offer packing only?
  a: Our packing is part of a package that includes the insured removal, so we can be responsible for your belongings from the first box to the new home. Talk to us if you need something different.
- q: Do you pack fragile items like china and ornaments?
  a: Yes. Fragile and sentimental items are packed with protective materials as standard, with no extra charge for careful handling.
- q: Will you unpack at the new home?
  a: Yes, from Silver Comfort. Unpacking and setting up the new home is included in that package and above. Bronze Essentials covers packing and the removal.
- q: Can I keep some things out of the packing?
  a: Of course. You decide what is packed. Medication, important papers and things you need straight away are kept accessible.
- q: How far ahead should I book?
  a: Most people book a few weeks before the move. Tell us your dates and we will say what is possible. For a large home or a tight timescale, the earlier the better.
- q: Is the removal insured?
  a: Yes. Every Chayce removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, and the cover is set out in your service agreement before the move begins.
- q: Do you work outside Northampton?
  a: Yes. We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the whole UK.
